  "notes": {
    "noteD": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": -320,
      "w": 390,
      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Both modes, everywhere\n• Header switch: Light · Dark · Auto. Auto follows your phone or computer setting and flips live at sunset if your system does.\n• Every face and state is shown in both rows.\n• Horizon shows a night sky in dark and a day sky in light; in Auto it follows the real time of day.\n• Press Play on any board: countdown, faces, presets and the theme switch all work."
    },
    "noteMotion": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": 200,
      "w": 390,
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Motion\n• Ring: glowing tip travels back, soft light sweep.\n• Bold: bar drains with slow shimmer.\n• Horizon: sun sets as the session ends; clouds, stars, glinting water.\n• Tide: water drains with waves and bubbles.\n• Tabs, presets and the theme switch slide. Reduced motion turns it all off."
    },
    "noteTime": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": 720,
      "w": 390,
      "text": "Time you can read at a glance\n• Saturday, 26 September 2026 · 10:00 PM at the top.\n• All times in AM/PM. Times past midnight say tomorrow.\n• Ready shows when it would end before you start."
    },
